# Frontend environment variables — all optional at this stage.
# Copy this file to frontend/.env to override any value. Never commit .env.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Browser runtime: base URL of the Strapi CMS API, as seen by the browser.
# - Leave unset in development: the Vite dev server proxies /api -> localhost:1337
#   (see vite.config.ts), so the browser uses same-origin relative URLs.
# - Set to the deployed CMS origin in production builds, e.g. https://cms.himam.dev
# VITE_CMS_API_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dev server only (never reaches the browser): Strapi origin used by the Vite
# dev proxy when VITE_CMS_API_URL is unset. Defaults to http://localhost:1337
# CMS_API_URL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact page (optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When set, the Contact page shows a "Book a call" button linking here (e.g.
# a Cal.com or Calendly scheduling link). When unset, the page tells visitors
# a scheduling link arrives with the reply instead.
# VITE_SCHEDULING_URL=
